# Title: Local Groups Discovery - MacOs
# ID: 89bb1f97-c7b9-40e8-b52b-7d6afbd67276
# Status: test
# Level: informational
# Author: Ömer Günal, Alejandro Ortuno, oscd.community
# Date: 2020-10-11
# Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1069.001
# Description: Detects enumeration of local system groups
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* ((process_path="*/dscacheutil" AND (process_exec="*-q*" AND process_exec="*group*")) OR (process_path="*/cat" AND process_exec="*/etc/group*") OR (process_path="*/dscl" AND (process_exec="*-list*" AND process_exec="*/groups*")))
